Container images
The images published to ghcr.io/otohatouka (touka-proxy, touka-heartbeat,
touka-chat) are built on the official python:3.12-slim-trixie and node
Docker images, which are based on Debian. Each image carries this NOTICE
and the project LICENSE in /app.

The Debian packages in the images (for example bash, coreutils, glibc and,
in touka-proxy, git) keep their own licenses, including GPL and LGPL; Debian
installs the license of each package as /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright.
Their source code is available from the Debian archive at
https://snapshot.debian.org. The base images are pinned by digest in
ToukaProxy/Dockerfile, ToukaHeartbeat/Dockerfile and ToukaChat/Dockerfile.prod.

Python and npm packages installed in the images keep their own license
files next to the package.
